  "metadata_observations": "All10 lexical endpoint headers across5 series have blank Laterality/ImageLaterality/FrameLaterality, one PatientID hash and one frame-of-reference hash per series. Series/acquisition numbers progress201/2,301/3,401/4,501/5,601/6. Distinct PD sagittal fat-suppressed/non-fat-suppressed, PD coronal fat-suppressed, T1 coronal and PD transverse fat-suppressed descriptions form one coherent protocol. Paired sagittal series share IOP, and paired coronal contrasts share IOP. All are Philips Ingenia, FFS. AcquisitionTime and SeriesTime are blank. No mixed explicit side tags or repeated complete multisequence protocol groups are present in the sampled metadata.",
